# Audit dumps contain live account data (IAM, DNS, contacts, secret names,
# security-group rules, etc.). Never commit them.
# Leading slash is required: an unanchored aws-audit-*/ also matches
# cmd/aws-audit-summarize and hides it from git and GoReleaser.
/aws-audit-*/
/summary.md
/errors.log
.env
.env.*
/bin/
/dist/
/aws-audit
/aws-audit-summarize

